{
  "_about": [
    "Skills in the news: which publisher feeds to read, and which words link a story to CareerCompass skills.",
    "Keyword rule: write a keyword in lowercase to match any capitalisation ('python' matches 'Python').",
    "Write it with capitals to match only that exact spelling ('AI' will not match 'ai' inside other words, 'Go' will not match 'go').",
    "Every keyword matches whole words only, and a trailing 's' is allowed ('robot' also matches 'robots').",
    "'news' keywords are searched in story headlines and summaries. 'skills' keywords are searched in the skill names careers list in careers.json.",
    "'skip_headlines': stories whose headline has one of these words are left out (stock-market chatter), unless the headline also has a story type like Layoffs or Hiring.",
    "'skills_exclude' removes skill names that the 'skills' keywords would otherwise catch by mistake.",
    "After editing, run: python scripts/check_news_topics.py  (it lists every skill and career each topic connects to)."
  ],
  "window_days": 7,
  "refresh_minutes": 30,
